    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on thompson1917-ch16-14: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.75";
    dc:description "The 120-degree prediction and mechanical optimum are quantitative. Public morphology can test the geometry broadly, but the claim about greatest uniform strength requires material and ligament properties rarely paired with scans.";
