    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Measure angular separation of dorsal and transverse vertebral processes in 3D fish and cetacean scans, then use beam models to compare stiffness isotropy at observed versus alternative angles.";
