    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Ligaments and soft tissues needed for stiffness are usually absent.", "Processes vary along the column.";
